        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리에 사용되는\n식재료 중 하나. 다양한 버섯의\n질감이 식감을 바꿔준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材之一。\n各種菇類的嚼勁\n會改變料理的口感。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nLa texture unique de chaque champignon\ninfluence la sensation en bouche du curry.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Die Konsistenz\nder verschiedenen Pilzsorten verleiht dem Curry eine\nbesondere Note.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. Los\ndistintos tipos de setas aportan diferentes texturas al\ncurri.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
